    },
    "absenceMarker": "ROW_DND_MIME — written and read only inside the reorder state machine, so its absence from every adapter root is the proof the machine left the base graph.",
    "reading": "The layer costs 0.74 KB and the state machine it displaced was 1.51 KB, which is the -0.7 KB each adapter root actually moved. The layer is paid once; every further feature that moves behind it is subtraction."
  }
